To find the coefficients, we can represent the recurrence relation as a matrix-vector multiplication:

\begin{bmatrix}
x_{n+3}\\
x_{n+2}\\
x_{n+1}
\end{bmatrix} =
\begin{bmatrix}
c_0 & c_1 & c_2\\
0 & c_0 & c_1\\
0 & 0 & c_0
\end{bmatrix} *
\begin{bmatrix}
x_n\\
x_{n+1}\\
x_{n+2}
\end{bmatrix}

Taking the first three terms of our given bitstream, we can create a system of equations:

\begin{bmatrix}
1 & 0 & 0\\
0 & 1 & 0\\
0 & 0 & 1
\end{bmatrix} *
\begin{bmatrix}
x_0\\
x_1\\
x_2
\end{bmatrix} =
\begin{bmatrix}
1\\
0\\
0
\end{bmatrix} +
\begin{bmatrix}
c_0 & c_1 & c_2\\
0 & c_0 & c_1\\
0 & 0 & c_0
\end{bmatrix} *
\begin{bmatrix}
0\\
1\\
0
\end{bmatrix}

